<title>JAPAN: Koa Oil - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Koa Oil - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 95.68		vs	   86.08</p>
<p> Operating   loss 516    mln	  vs	 prft 45 mln</p>
<p> Current		1.16		vs	  907    mln</p>
<p> Net		  777    mln	  vs	  512    mln</p>
<p> EPS		    5.35 yen	  vs	    3.53 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    145 million	  vs	 145 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Koa Oil Co Ltd is an oil refiner affiliated with the Celtex group.</p>
</text>
